{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2023-04-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2023 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION (NYSE: AMT) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH\xa031, 2023. TOM BARTLETT, AMERICAN TOWER'S CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, STATED, “WE'RE OFF TO A STRONG START IN 2023. IN Q1, WE SAW AN ACCELERATION IN ORGANIC TENANT BILLINGS GROWTH, ANOTHER RECORD QUARTER OF SIGNED NEW BUSINESS AT CORESITE AND OUR 11TH CONSECUTIVE QUARTER OF DELIVERING OVER 1,000 BUILT SITES, ALL OF WHICH DEMONSTRATES RESILIENT DEMAND ACROSS OUR PORTFOLIO OF D."}